# Mosquitto ACL — per-client topic authorisation.
#
# Requested policy:
#   pi    : readwrite telescope/pi/#
#   phone : read telescope/status/#, write telescope/commands/#
#
# Two lines are added to those, because the requested policy alone cannot close
# a control loop: the phone must be able to read the state the Pi publishes, and
# the Pi must be able to read the commands the phone writes. Without them the
# broker is secure and useless. Every other topic is denied by default.

user pi
topic readwrite telescope/pi/#
topic write telescope/status/#
topic read telescope/commands/#
# Broker statistics, used by the container healthcheck and by monitoring.
topic read $SYS/#

user phone
topic read telescope/status/#
topic write telescope/commands/#
